e (my life)","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna touch you, I don't wanna be","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Just another ex-love you don't wanna see","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna miss you (I don't wanna miss you) like the other girls do","columns":71,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't wanna hurt you, I just wanna be","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Drinking on a beach with you all over me","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"I know what they all say (I know what they all say) but i ain't tryna play","columns":74,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna be your end game","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna be your first string","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna be your A-Team","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I wanna be your end game, end game","columns":34,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Now well, when I was young, we connected, when we were little bit older","columns":71,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Both sprung, I got issues and chips on both of my shoulders","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","c